Jonathan,
Why do you think Linux, by it self, can't meet Ch.8 of the NISPOM manual???
Granted I would like to see more people use SELinux in these secure environments
but I don't know of any reason why you can't get Linux to fit under NISPOM...
We use it here and have not seen any problems.....I would say check with your
security rep as to what you can and can't do.....
Ken



